==Finnish==

===Pronunciation===
{{fi-p}}

===Etymology 1===
{{etymid|fi|five}}

====Numeral====
{{head|fi|numeral}} {{tlb|fi|colloquial}}

# {{alt form|fi|viisi||five}}
#: {{uxi|fi|Se maksaa '''viis''' euroo.|It costs '''five''' euros.}}

===Etymology 2===
{{etymid|fi|interjection}}
Possibly from the numeral {{m|fi|viisi||five}}, but it is not known why exactly this numeral. A somehow similar use is found in {{ncog|sv|sju||seven}}, in the expression {{m|sv||jag bryr mig sju|I don't care at all|lit=I care seven}}.

====Interjection====
{{head|fi|interjections}} {{tlb|fi|informal}}

# {{n-g|Said to ignore something}}
#: {{uxi|fi|'''Viis''' siitä!|'''Screw''' it!}}
#: {{uxi|fi|Sataa. Siitä '''viis'''! Menen silti ulos.|It's raining. '''I don't care'''! I'll go out anyway.}}
# {{only used in|fi|viis veisata||to not give a damn}}

